          "text": "Description: On October 21, 1977, around 6:30 PM, two people observed the horizontal movement to the east of a round-shaped light phenomenon. The phenomenon quickly disappeared into the cloud mass. No noise was heard. No other testimony about this phenomenon was collected, for which we lack information.",
